Cash used in operating activities for the six months ended June 30, 2026 was $95.4 million, which consisted of a net loss of $236.1 million, offset by a net change of $11.7 million in our net operating assets and liabilities, and $128.9 million in non-cash charges. The non-cash charges primarily consisted of a change in fair value on the 2022 USD Financing Warrants liability of $106.3 million, share-based compensation expense of $16.8 million, change in fair value of DDSU of $6.2 million, and accretion of discount on investments, net of $0.8 million.

